  "plot": "A look at the lives and loves of a group of high- school students. In his final year of high school, Brad Hamilton decides that he should break up with his long-time girlfriend to play the field, but she breaks up with him first. Jeff Spicoli continues to delight in getting under the skin of his teacher, Mr. Hand. Others are looking for love or sex and just plain having a good time which, for the most part, they all seem to find, though sometimes in unexpected places.",
